  {
   "id": "uncertainty",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 5390,
   "width": 500,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "2",
   "text": "### Uncertainty<br><br>- Abstract-only sources keep their limit<br>- Effect sizes are population averages<br>- Reviews inherit the biases of their studies"
  },
  {
   "id": "hypothesis",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 5390,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### Open questions<br><br>- What design would let a claim about a mechanism be tested rather than merely observed?<br>- Which confounders can be measured, and which only randomised assignment can balance?<br>- How far can a result travel before the population no longer matches?"
  },
  {
   "id": "evidence-basis",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1180,
   "y": 5390,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 790,
   "color": "4",
   "text": "### Evidence basis<br><br>F09: public-page, educational_checked<br>P39701638: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>P40154799: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>F22: official-page, educational_checked<br>P29566425: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>P31949163: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>P28461699: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>P39843750: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>P31981491: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>P33549739: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>P38695002: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>P23997866: public-page, full_text_checked<br>P26952180: open-access-online, full_text_checked<br>P27209009: open-access-online, full_text_checked<br>P29942800: open-access-online, full_text_checked<br>P27620683: public-page, full_text_checked<br>P28686856: public-page, full_text_checked<br>F07: public-page, educational_checked<br>P24808851: open-access-online, full_text_checked<br>F17: public-page, educational_checked<br>P40948064: abstract-only, abstract_checked<br>F23: official-page, educational_checked<br>P29029837: abstract-only, abstract_checked"
